  "summary": "A signed QN Wallpaper adware installer sideloads a malicious libcef.dll that AES-decrypts and loads the ValleyRAT backdoor, a campaign attributed to Silver Fox and masquerading as adware. ValleyRAT parses a reversed UTF-16LE config, injects into svchost, optionally marks its process critical to trigger a BSOD on termination, and supports keylogging, clipboard capture, screenshotting and module loading via process hollowing.",
